==============================================================================
PART (a): explicit threshold C_0(gamma), tightened leading constant
==============================================================================

Ghat(n,gamma) ~ lambda_hat(gamma) ln(n) for large n (script 04 Step 3),
lambda_hat(gamma) := 16(7/4-gamma)/beta(gamma). The tail piece of W scales
like n^{-2C^2 + lambda_hat(gamma) + 1/2} (the +1/2 from Gn_bound~sqrt(n)).
Vanishing requires C^2 > 1/4 + lambda_hat(gamma)/2, i.e.

    C_0(gamma) := sqrt(1/4 + lambda_hat(gamma)/2).

   gamma       beta   lambda_hat   C_0(gamma)
    0.99   0.499950      24.3224       3.5230
     0.9   0.495000      27.4747       3.7400
     0.7   0.455000      36.9231       4.3257
     0.5   0.375000      53.3333       5.1881
     0.3   0.255000      90.9804       6.7631
     0.1   0.095000     277.8947      11.7982
    0.05   0.048750     557.9487      16.7100
    0.01   0.009950    2797.9899      37.4065
   0.001   0.000999   27997.9990     118.3184

